type: software
title: "Geometric Null Ontological Spectral Invariant Symmetry"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained, machine-verified formalization in Lean 4 (v4.28.0)
  establishing the constructive emergence and spectral rigidity of the
  rank-2 Euclidean Jordan spin factor V_5, the Cartan Type IV bounded
  symmetric domain D_5, and the 8-dimensional Tits-Kantor-Koecher (TKK)
  conformal representation W_8 from a single algebraic zero (0) with
  zero axioms, zero sorrys, zero external dependencies, and zero free
  parameters. Modules 1-3 enforce a sterile Mathematical Firewall
  synthesizing 23 pure spectral invariants, which Module 4 maps 1-to-1
  to physical observables and verifies in the Lean kernel across 23
  measured 1-sigma empirical intervals (> 197 bits of joint Shannon
  information).
authors:
